      children: "Isliye Osho kahte hain — Om ka abhyaas mrityu ke liye nahin, aaj ke liye hai. Roz thoda moun, roz kuch pal vichaaron se pare — yehi Om ki taiyaari hai. Aur jab Om bheetar se uththa hai, tab koi mantra nahin chahiye. Krishna kehti hain \"sulabh\" — Osho ise aise samjhaate hain: jo aadmi moun mein rehta hai, woh Om ko nahin dhoondhta; Om khud uske paas aata hai. Aur wohi \"sulabh\" hai. Mrityu ke dwar par woh aadmi koi jaap nahin karega — woh khud dhwani ban jaayega. Yeh Osho ki is adhyaya ki sabse gehri baat hai."
